{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本日！\n乃木坂工事中SPです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/12/29/0840534/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"木曜日だけど工事中やるよ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"欅ちゃんがゲスト出演してくれました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田は\nおだななとゆっかーとはぶちゃんしか\n共演した事ないから\nちょっとドキドキしてたけど\n楽しかったよ～\\( ･ω･)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/12/29/0840534/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"24:30〜25:30 テレビ東京系\n乃木坂工事中SP【乃木坂46&欅坂46合同大忘年会！】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可愛い子ばっかりで\n観てて楽しいよ、きっと"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/12/29/0840534/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一昨日は生ドルでした～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゲストは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マジカル・ パンチラインさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/12/29/0840534/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"佐藤麗奈さん、浅野杏奈さん、沖口優奈さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回来てくださってから\nさゆりんも中田もすっかり\nマジパンさんが好きになっちゃってたから\n嬉しかった！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回も前回もさとれなさんに\nたくさん助けてもらっちゃいました...\n可愛いし喋れるし もう完璧"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/12/29/0840534/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ツインテールのコーナーでは\nあんちゃんさんがやってくださいました！\nありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/12/29/0840534/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可愛かったでゅふふふ（カナヲボイス）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆうなさんのオチ担当は\n普通にいじりました...すみません...\nでも、お話面白いし\n友達になりたいタイプだとすごい思いました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カナヲはマジパンさんには\n敵わないらしいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/12/29/0840534/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2回目の出演\nありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/12/29/0840534/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆるっと革命団さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/12/29/0840534/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"白坂祐梨さん、有末陽菜実さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"白坂さんが乃木坂が好きで\nしかもさゆりん推しって言ってくれて\nなんかこっちまで嬉しかった～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"有末さんに『あめ色ストーリー』のダンス\n教えてもらったけど教えるのがお上手で\nすぐ踊れるようになったよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/12/29/0840534/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"振付可愛い！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おさわり占いが\nいつもよりもなんか凄かったね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/12/29/0840534/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"失礼致しました..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださってありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早い時間なのに観てくださり\nありがとうございました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"機材トラブル申し訳ないです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/12/29/0840534/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントもありがとうね！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Pigooの方もよろしくお願いいたします"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年ラスト生ドルでしたねえ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来年も観てね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}